  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……お、すまん、読書中か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "大丈夫です！　なんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "009",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、全然大したことじゃないんだ\r\nそれより、何を読んでるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ……これです！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "おっきなオオカミを助ける女の子のお話です！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お……懐かしいなあ\r\n俺も小さい頃に読んだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんもですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう。今でも人気なんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもそれ、小さい子向けの本じゃなかったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　１年生向けの絵本です……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "学校で、秋の読書月間っていうのをやってて……\r\n朝の15分は本を読みましょうって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ……あったなあ、そういうの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それで、読む本を探しに図書館に行ったら、\r\nこれを見つけました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ちっちゃいころ、いつもお母さんが読んでくれたんですっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "久しぶりに読みたくなって、借りちゃいました……！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな\r\nでもそれ、読書の時間用だったんだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "絵本だから、学校では読まなかったとか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ……ちょっとちがいます！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "先生は、『読むことを好きになってもらいたいから\r\n興味があるものならマンガでも絵本でもいいよ』って",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "──でも、学校で読むのはまだ読んでないのにしたくて……\r\nこれを持っていくのはやめました！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……\r\nだから事務所で読んでたってことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！\r\nなので、実はまだ、学校で読む本を探しています……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それで──プロデューサーさん、\r\n何かおすすめの本ってありませんか！？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、プロデューサーさんがあたしくらいの時に、\r\nどんな本を読んでたか知りたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、それを読み終わったら、\r\n一緒に図書館まで行ってみるのはどうだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いくつか見繕うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "本当ですかっ！？",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nそれで、──これは俺の用事になっちゃうんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "図書館に行った後に、\r\n今日のおやつに相応しいもの、一緒に考えてほしいんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしが考えていいんですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう。さっき声かけたのはこのためだからな\r\n──読書のお供にピッタリのもの、選んでくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ……おやつと読書……！\r\nなんだか、大人の人みたいですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "──りょうかいしました！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、読書にピッタリのおやつ、\r\n探してみせます……！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "準備ばんたんです！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっ……この絵本はもういいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　たくさん読んでもらって覚えてるので──\r\nまた後で読みますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今は、早くプロデューサーさんおすすめの\r\n本を読んでみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ……学校で読む分と、\r\n事務所で読む分を、ふたつ……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110250,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんに決めてほしいです！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、了解だ\r\n気合いを入れて選ぼう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110260,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ……ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009008110270,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "じゃあ、行きましょう、プロデューサーさん──！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900811/2009008110270"
